{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"Sets tags for a specific email address with a completion handler.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setEmailTags:forEmail:completion:"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setemailtags:foremail:completion:"]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setEmailTags:forEmail:completion:","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setEmailTags:forEmail:completion:","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setEmailTags:forEmail:completion:"}],"title":"setEmailTags:forEmail:completion:"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setEmailTags:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSDictionary","text":"NSDictionary"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"tags"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"forEmail:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"email","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"completion:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"kind":"text","text":" (^"},{"text":")(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSError","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSError"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"error","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":")) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"completion","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dictionary of tag names and values to associate with the email."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"tags"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The email address to associate tags with.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"email"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Block called when the operation completes."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Receives nil on success, or an NSError on failure.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"completion"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Same as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setEmailTags:forEmail:"},{"type":"text","text":" but provides confirmation when the operation completes."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Use this when you need to verify tags were set before proceeding with other operations.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Example","type":"heading","anchor":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Verify email and update tags with confirmation:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["class EmailVerificationService {","","    func completeEmailVerification(email: String, verificationCode: String,","                                   completion: @escaping (Result<Void, Error>) -> Void) {","","        APIClient.shared.verifyEmail(email, code: verificationCode) { result in","            switch result {","            case .success:","                let verificationTags: [String: Any] = [","                    \"email_verified\": true,","                    \"verification_date\": ISO8601DateFormatter().string(from: Date()),","                    \"verification_method\": \"code\"","                ]","","                Pushwoosh.configure.setEmailTags(verificationTags, forEmail: email) { error in","                    if let error = error {","                        Logger.warning(\"Email tags update failed: \\(error.localizedDescription)\")","                        \/\/ Continue anyway - email is verified on backend","                    }","","                    \/\/ Also update device tags","                    Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([\"has_verified_email\": true])","","                    completion(.success(()))","                }","","            case .failure(let error):","                completion(.failure(error))","            }","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"abstract":[{"text":"Protocol defining SDK configuration methods.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"PWConfiguration","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setEmailTags:forEmail:completion:":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setEmailTags:forEmail:completion:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"setEmailTags:forEmail:completion:","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"setEmailTags:forEmail:completion:"}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setemailtags:foremail:completion:","abstract":[{"text":"Sets tags for a specific email address with a completion handler.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setEmailTags:forEmail:completion:"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","kind":"symbol","title":"PushwooshCore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"role":"collection","type":"topic"}}}